  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Four identical rectangular plates with length, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and breadth, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> are arranged as shown in figure. The equivalent capacitance between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is _______.</p><p>(Round off to the Nearest Integer)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0089_79b136839007.png\" style=\"width: 214px; height: 215px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0089_6a690919e4df.png\" style=\"width: 198px; height: 263px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
